Z||000045||batboy||08-18-2000||10:48 PM||||Oh come on now Lou, 148 MPH!?! What was your RPM? Even with a 5 speed, I suspect that would be past red-line. You running super tall tires or a different gear ratio? You must have the fastest street Fiero in the world. Wow, I wish I had a 3.4 Fiero that could beat all the V8 Fieros like that too.||||reg||1
